<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Deutsche Morgan starts 3 stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Deutsche Morgan starts 3 stocks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said analyst Joel Pitt initiated coverage of three stocks in the computer peripherals industry.</p>
<p>-- The analyst put a buy rating on Quantum Corp and acccumlate ratings on Seagate Technology Inc and Western Digital Corp.</p>
